  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.0.1075\n- Improved using WritableBitmap PresentationType for WPF: now the staging buffer is preserved and recreated for each frame.\n- Fixed calling RenderToBitmap when using WPF and PresentationType is set to OverlayTexture.\n- Added OverlayControlsSample sample for WPF that shows how to render WPF controls to a bitmap and show that as Sprites. This can be used to render WPF controls on top of a 3D scene when using OverlayTexture PresentationMode (this mode prevents rendering WPF controls on top of a 3D scene so Sprites provide a way to render non-interactive controls on top of 3D scene).",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "Ab4d.SharpEngine.Wpf defines WPF controls that can show 3D scene rendered by Ab4d.SharpEngine rendering engine",
